    <briefdescription>
<para>This structure contains the information necessary for lowering pointer-authenticating indirect calls. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It is equivalent to the &quot;ptrauth&quot; operand bundle found on the call instruction, if any. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
